-- title:
--   Verschiebung of a height-4 formal mathcal O_D-module
-- statement:
--   Let $p$ be a prime and $\kappa$ a field of characteristic $p$, and let $\Phi$ be a formal $\mathcal O_D$-module over $\kappa$, i.e. a commutative $2$-dimensional formal group law $\Phi.F$ over $\kappa$ together with a map $a \mapsto \Phi.\mathrm{act}\,a$ from $\mathbb Z_{p^2} = W(\mathbb F_{p^2})$ to pairs of power series in two variables and a further pair $\Phi.\mathrm{varpi}$, all of them endomorphisms of $\Phi.F$, such that $\mathrm{act}$ sends $1$ to the identity, products to composites and sums to sums via $\Phi.F$, and $\mathrm{varpi} \circ \mathrm{varpi} = \mathrm{act}\,p$, $\mathrm{varpi} \circ \mathrm{act}\,a = \mathrm{act}(\sigma a) \circ \mathrm{varpi}$ for the Witt-vector Frobenius $\sigma$. Assume $\Phi$ has height $4$: the kernel algebra of $\mathrm{act}\,p$ is finite and projective over $\kappa$ and has dimension $p^4$ over every field receiving a ring homomorphism from $\kappa$. Let $m \in \mathbb N$. Then there is a pair of power series $V$ over $\kappa$ which (i) is a homomorphism of formal $\mathcal O_D$-modules from the base change of $\Phi$ along the $m$-th iterate of the Frobenius $x \mapsto x^p$ of $\kappa$ to $\Phi$, that is, a homomorphism of the underlying laws with zero constant terms commuting with the actions of all $a$ and with $\mathrm{varpi}$; (ii) satisfies: substituting $X_i^{p^m}$ into $V$ gives $\Phi.\mathrm{act}(p^m)$; and (iii) has kernel algebra finite and projective over $\kappa$, of dimension $p^{2m}$ over every field receiving a ring homomorphism from $\kappa$.
--
--   This is the Verschiebung factorisation $[p^m] = V_m \circ \mathrm{Frob}^m$ for a formal $\mathcal O_D$-module of height $4$ over a field of characteristic $p$, with $V_m$ an $\mathcal O_D$-linear isogeny of height $2m$. It is used in the study of rigidifications of fake elliptic curves and in the analysis of the ideal generated by $\mathrm{varpi}$, on the Čerednik–Drinfeld side of the construction.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_CerednikDrinfeld_FormalODModule_exists_isODHom_map_iterateFrobenius_comp_X_pow_eq_act_pow.lean

import Mathlib
import Definitions.Def_MvFormalGroup_NegV2
import Definitions.Def_CerednikDrinfeld_SpecialFormalModule

set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 400000
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency.types false

set_option autoImplicit false

universe u

open CerednikDrinfeld CerednikDrinfeld.SpecialFormal

theorem CerednikDrinfeld.FormalODModule.exists_isODHom_map_iterateFrobenius_comp_X_pow_eq_act_pow
    {p : ℕ} [Fact p.Prime] {κ : Type u} [Field κ] [CharP κ p]
    (Φ : FormalODModule p κ) (hΦ4 : Φ.HasHeight 4) (m : ℕ) :
    ∃ V : Series κ,
      FormalODModule.IsODHom (Φ.map (iterateFrobenius κ p m)) Φ V ∧
      V.comp (fun i => (MvPowerSeries.X i : MvPowerSeries (Fin 2) κ) ^ (p ^ m)) =
        Φ.act ((p : Zp2 p) ^ m) ∧
      FormalODModule.HasKernelOfDegree V (p ^ (2 * m)) := by sorry
